doctype html
html
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    title New IT Request Notification
  body(style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f7f8fa; margin: 0; padding: 0;")
    table(width="100%", cellspacing="0", cellpadding="0", style="max-width: 650px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);")
      tr
        td(style="padding: 35px;")

          h2(style="color: #2b2d42; margin-top: 0; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;") Dear IT Team,
          p(style="color: #333333; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px;")
            | The following IT request is open :

          // Request Info Table
          table(width="100%", cellpadding="4", cellspacing="0", style="font-size: 14px; color: #333; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 25px;")
            tr
              td(width="160", style="font-weight: bold; color: #2b2d42; padding: 6px 0;") Request Number
              td: span(style="font-weight: bold;") #{requestNumber}
            tr
              td(style="font-weight: bold; color: #2b2d42; padding: 6px 0;") Requested by
              td #{requestorName}
            tr
              td(style="font-weight: bold; color: #2b2d42; padding: 6px 0;") Request Date
              td #{requestDate}
            tr
              td(style="font-weight: bold; color: #2b2d42; padding: 6px 0;") Description
              td: span(style="font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;") #{requestDescription}
            tr
              td(style="font-weight: bold; color: #2b2d42; padding: 6px 0;") Status
              td Open

          // SLA Section
          p(style="color: #333333; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 10px;")
            | This Service represents a Service Level Agreement (SLA):
          ul(style="color: #555555; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 0; padding-left: 20px;")
            li Request must be processed within 1 day.
            li Please contact IT Helpdesk if request takes more than 1 day.

          // Links Section
          div(style="margin-top: 25px;")
            p(style="color: #333; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;")
              | 🔗 
              a(href='#{publicLink}', style='color:#1a73e8; text-decoration:none;') Open Public Link
            p(style="color: #333; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px;")
              | 🌐 
              a(href='#{smoeLink}', style='color:#1a73e8; text-decoration:none;') Open SMOE Portal

          // Footer
          p(style="color: #777; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 35px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; line-height: 1.5;")
            | This is a system generated email. Please do not reply to this address.
            br
            | © #{currentYear} IT Service – SEATRIUM BATAM
